{"id":"CVE-2005-2666","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2005-08-23T04:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-07T22:45:01.578Z","description":"SSH, as implemented in OpenSSH before 4.0 and possibly other implementations, stores hostnames, IP addresses, and keys in plaintext in the known_hosts file, which makes it easier for an attacker that has compromised an SSH user's account to generate a list of additional targets that are more likely to have the same password or key.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A10201","tags":["vdb-entry","signature","x_refsource_OVAL"],"name":"oval:org.mitre.oval:def:10201"},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/25098","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"25098"},{"url":"http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2007-0257.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_REDHAT"],"name":"RHSA-2007:0257"},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/19243","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"19243"},{"url":"http://www.eweek.com/article2/0%2C1759%2C1815795%2C00.asp","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"ftp://ftp.sco.com/pub/updates/OpenServer/SCOSA-2006.11/SCOSA-2006.11.txt","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SCO"],"name":"SCOSA-2006.11"},{"url":"http://nms.csail.mit.edu/projects/ssh/","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]}],"vendors":["openssh"]}
